**Summary of design decisions:**

| Milestone | Rule Type | Key Params | Rationale |
|-----------|-----------|------------|-----------|
| `find_gray_wool` | `position_near_with_facing` | target=[11,2,9], max_distance=5, facing_tolerance=60° | "Find" task → use position_near_with_facing per preference order. Reduced max_distance from 16→5 per CommonSenseAgent feedback to prevent trivial completion at spawn. |
| `shear_sheep` | `inventory_has` | item="gray_wool", min_count=1 | Shearing produces an inventory item → inventory_has is the #1 preferred rule. Gray sheep drop gray_wool. Player starts with 0 wool so any gray_wool confirms shearing. |

**Verified in sandbox:**
- Gray wool structure confirmed at spawn-relative (10-12, 1-3, 8-10), center (11, 2, 9)
- Two gray sheep confirmed at spawn-relative (~10,1,13) and (~12,1,14)
- Shears confirmed in player hotbar
- Agent reached gray wool in ~14 steps, sheep positioned just beyond

